[[File:Anakin_looking_dramatic.png|thumb|right|250px|Anakin riding Owen Lars' swoop bike.]]
A '''swoop''', or '''swoop bike''', was a type of [[repulsorlift]] vehicle designed for speed. In essence, it was a more dangerous version of a [[speeder bike]] that both its enthusiasts and its detractors described as an "[[engine]] with a seat." Although more powerful than speeder bikes, swoops were crude and lacked finesse. They were hard to control, requiring instinct, strength, and timing.<ref name="TOG">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]''</ref>

Swoop races were popular on many [[planet]]s across [[the galaxy]] and were loved for their excitement and outlaw image. The [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Anakin Skywalker]] used a [[Zephyr-G swoop]] owned by his stepbrother [[Owen Lars]] while searching for his mother, [[Shmi Skywalker Lars]], on the planet [[Tatooine]]. The criminal [[Ohnaka Gang]] used swoops to patrol near their [[Hondo's complex|base]] on the planet [[Florrum]].<ref name="DB">{{Databank|swoop|Swoop}}</ref>

